1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,712
A coding agent built this page from a
design.

2
00:00:03,712 --> 00:00:04,882
It looks right.

3
00:00:04,882 --> 00:00:07,926
But "looks right" is not a requirement.

4
00:00:07,926 --> 00:00:12,687
And "fix what looks wrong" gives the agent
nothing to act on.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:20,469
ConformUI turns the design into a
contract: a list of requirements you can

6
00:00:20,469 --> 00:00:20,896
check.

7
00:00:20,896 --> 00:00:23,745
Gemma 4 reads the design on this device.

8
00:00:23,745 --> 00:00:26,450
The network is off, so nothing leaves.

9
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:31,007
Mobile expectations are inferred, so they
are labelled advisory.

10
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:50,337
Every number comes from a deterministic
engine, not a model.

11
00:00:50,337 --> 00:00:52,649
The CTA is 132 pixels wide.

12
00:00:52,649 --> 00:00:54,362
The design says 220.

13
00:00:54,362 --> 00:00:57,615
The engine trace shows what ran where.

14
00:00:57,615 --> 00:01:00,955
And still, nothing has left the device.

15
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:22,306
Some judgements are harder.

16
00:01:22,306 --> 00:01:24,647
For those, I choose the cloud.

17
00:01:24,647 --> 00:01:30,030
Before anything leaves, I see exactly what
is sent and how big it is.

18
00:01:30,030 --> 00:01:35,179
The result is labelled Cloud, so it never
pretends to be measured.

19
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:49,991
The fix prompt gives the agent measured
instructions it can verify.

20
00:01:49,991 --> 00:01:51,850
Not "make it look better".

21
00:01:51,850 --> 00:01:54,281
"Make the button 220 pixels wide."

22
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:13,297
Re-verify checks the same contract again.

23
00:02:13,297 --> 00:02:14,958
6 issues are resolved.

24
00:02:14,958 --> 00:02:18,886
1 spacing issue remains, and it comes with
evidence.

25
00:02:18,886 --> 00:02:22,436
So the agent's "done" is now a measured
"done".

26
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:37,909
Reports export as Markdown or JSON.

27
00:02:37,909 --> 00:02:43,714
Where on-device AI is not available, the
first pass runs in the cloud, only

28
00:02:43,714 --> 00:02:46,578
after consent, and the badge says so.

29
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:52,892
Design intent as a contract.

30
00:02:52,892 --> 00:02:55,007
Measured, not guessed.

31
00:02:55,007 --> 00:02:56,834
Private by default.
